#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:4 2feb947bb3e24df39b48d1328f8737db
msgid "开发 Godot-FmodPlayer"
msgstr "Develop Godot-FmodPlayer"

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:6 428e1eac7b4a46268cf3b616234d7e72
msgid "从插件仓库构建扩展，再把完整插件部署到测试项目。以下命令默认在插件仓库根目录执行，日常验证流程见 :doc:`testing`。"
msgstr ""
"Build the extension from the plugin repository, then stage the complete addon in the test "
"project. Unless noted otherwise, run these commands from the plugin repository root. See "
":doc:`testing` for the everyday validation workflow."

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:9 aed9aba8ea8d4b859ddfc594613b0771
msgid "准备环境"
msgstr "Prepare the environment"

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:11 e3ebffe30dde4e26a517f46ff95603b8
msgid "Godot 4.7.2 或更新版本、Git、Python 3 和 SCons。"
msgstr "Godot 4.7.2 or later, Git, Python 3, and SCons."

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:12 ca1ce2440fc7468c8cdabf6507ce4ac6
msgid "支持 C++17 的编译器：Windows 使用 MSVC，Linux 使用 GCC 或 Clang；Android 使用 NDK 工具链。"
msgstr "A C++17 compiler: MSVC on Windows, GCC or Clang on Linux, or the NDK toolchain for Android."

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:13 4f13c3dfc4a24c04a53a4f02bdfedf17
msgid "目标平台的 FMOD Core SDK 2.04；头文件、链接库和运行库使用同一 SDK 发布版本。"
msgstr ""
"FMOD Core SDK 2.04 for the target platform. Use headers, link libraries, and runtime libraries "
"from the same SDK release."

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:15 8a5a2efb07e3447fbcaa17bd4e62db1f
msgid ""
"git clone --recurse-submodules https://github.com/LuYingYiLong/Godot-FmodPlayer.git\n"
"cd Godot-FmodPlayer\n"
"python -m pip install scons"
msgstr ""
"git clone --recurse-submodules https://github.com/LuYingYiLong/Godot-FmodPlayer.git\n"
"cd Godot-FmodPlayer\n"
"python -m pip install scons"

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:21 cf65aea523d24775b4bf3ac28314c5a7
msgid ""
"已有工作副本可运行 ``git submodule update --init --recursive``，恢复项目固定的 godot-cpp 提交。项目的 ``SConstruct`` "
"默认使用 ``api_version=4.7``，通常无需自行导出 API JSON。"
msgstr ""
"In an existing checkout, run ``git submodule update --init --recursive`` to use the project's "
"pinned godot-cpp commit. The project ``SConstruct`` defaults to ``api_version=4.7``; a separately"
" exported API JSON is normally unnecessary."

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:23 8b69590e81b24484b91f0eb2f0221f94
msgid ""
"Windows 可使用 Visual Studio 的“使用 C++ 的桌面开发”工作负载，并安装 Windows SDK。可打开仓库中的 ``Godot-"
"FmodPlayer.slnx``，或使用其他编辑器后从命令行构建。"
msgstr ""
"On Windows, install the Visual Studio Desktop development with C++ workload and a Windows SDK. "
"Open ``Godot-FmodPlayer.slnx`` or use another editor and build from the command line."

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:25 40d85f965c874193a1413cc4f76a1001
msgid "Visual Studio C++ workload"
msgstr "Visual Studio C++ workload"

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:30 92c213abc6c34e37b3f4ddaaa9e6ef39
msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:32 6af76260cfa443769685232d675aad9d
msgid ""
"将 Windows SDK 的 ``api/core/inc`` 复制到 ``src/thirdparty/fmod/inc``，将 ``api/core/lib/x64`` 中的文件复制到 "
"``src/thirdparty/fmod/lib/x64``。把其中的 ``fmod.dll`` 放入 ``addons/fmod_player/bin``。"
msgstr ""
"Copy ``api/core/inc`` from the Windows SDK to ``src/thirdparty/fmod/inc``, and the files in "
"``api/core/lib/x64`` to ``src/thirdparty/fmod/lib/x64``. Place ``fmod.dll`` in "
"``addons/fmod_player/bin``."

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:34 8b8353e0511640b993eb4794873cf674
msgid ""
"scons platform=windows target=template_debug arch=x86_64 copy_to_tests=yes\n"
"scons platform=windows target=template_release arch=x86_64"
msgstr ""
"scons platform=windows target=template_debug arch=x86_64 copy_to_tests=yes\n"
"scons platform=windows target=template_release arch=x86_64"

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:39 f5c3731da9eb464dace0a706da485a7f
msgid ""
"``template_debug`` 用于编辑器和调试运行，``template_release`` 用于发布导出。输出文件位于 "
"``addons/fmod_player/bin``；对应文件名与架构必须匹配 ``fmod_player.gdextension``。"
msgstr ""
"Use ``template_debug`` for the editor and debug runs, and ``template_release`` for release "
"exports. Outputs are written to ``addons/fmod_player/bin``; their names and architectures must "
"match ``fmod_player.gdextension``."

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:42 835ac222db2b4bcba7d2a976aa601dcf
msgid "Linux"
msgstr "Linux"

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:44 691cee055d034a8fae761cac0ea5393b
msgid "使用 FMOD Linux Core SDK。在 Git 忽略的根目录 ``custom.py`` 中指定 SDK 根目录或其 ``api/core`` 目录："
msgstr ""
"Use the FMOD Linux Core SDK. In the Git-ignored root ``custom.py``, specify the SDK root or its "
"``api/core`` directory:"

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:46 b05dd5e92f0d43dab0df96df9ab3958c
msgid "fmod_linux_sdk = \"/path/to/fmodstudioapi20400linux\""
msgstr "fmod_linux_sdk = \"/path/to/fmodstudioapi20400linux\""

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:50 041dfc1a93674822b43a0059c4edd9fb
msgid ""
"scons platform=linux target=template_debug arch=x86_64 copy_to_tests=yes\n"
"scons platform=linux target=template_release arch=x86_64"
msgstr ""
"scons platform=linux target=template_debug arch=x86_64 copy_to_tests=yes\n"
"scons platform=linux target=template_release arch=x86_64"

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:55 ae275c7073394c319af89a265cc9d9ba
msgid ""
"也可通过 ``FMOD_LINUX_SDK`` 环境变量配置路径。Debug 运行需要 ``libfmodL.so.15``，Release 需要 "
"``libfmod.so.15``；放在扩展库旁，保留正确的文件名或符号链接。构建时 ``copy_to_tests=yes`` 会从本地 SDK 复制对应运行库。"
msgstr ""
"You can also set the path with ``FMOD_LINUX_SDK``. Debug runs require ``libfmodL.so.15`` and "
"release runs require ``libfmod.so.15`` beside the extension. Preserve the correct filenames or "
"symbolic links. With ``copy_to_tests=yes``, the build copies the matching runtime from the local "
"SDK."

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:58 3f4f2fe78a3a421b81fe50c581ce8370
msgid "Android"
msgstr "Android"

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:60 2d5e3d1929b5427ebd758621d0a6554e
msgid ""
"安装 Android SDK、NDK 和 FMOD Android Core SDK。``ANDROID_HOME`` 指向 SDK 根目录；NDK 位于其 ``ndk/<版本号>`` "
"子目录。已设置正确的 ``ANDROID_HOME`` 时，通常只需在项目的 ``custom.py`` 中固定已安装的 ``ndk_version``。"
msgstr ""
"Install the Android SDK, an NDK, and the FMOD Android Core SDK. ``ANDROID_HOME`` points to the "
"SDK root, with NDKs under ``ndk/<version>``. If ``ANDROID_HOME`` is already correct, pinning an "
"installed ``ndk_version`` in the project's ``custom.py`` is usually sufficient."

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:62 3df29677b765474bb70b495e2ac2fadf
msgid "下面的路径和版本号仅为示例，请替换为本机实际值："
msgstr "The paths and version below are examples; replace them with your local values:"

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:64 6d01b8fd72b2446d8fc156d0aaa3016b
msgid ""
"ANDROID_HOME = r\"C:\\Android\\Sdk\"\n"
"ndk_version = \"30.0.16248370\"\n"
"fmod_android_sdk = r\"C:\\SDKs\\FMOD-Android\""
msgstr ""
"ANDROID_HOME = r\"C:\\Android\\Sdk\"\n"
"ndk_version = \"30.0.16248370\"\n"
"fmod_android_sdk = r\"C:\\SDKs\\FMOD-Android\""

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:70 693f720ab21046559b272c4073c8b275
msgid ""
"``fmod_android_sdk`` 接受 SDK 根目录或 ``api/core``，也可通过 ``FMOD_ANDROID_SDK`` 环境变量提供默认路径。固定并保留已验证的 "
"NDK，可避免 godot-cpp 默认 NDK 版本变化影响本项目。"
msgstr ""
"``fmod_android_sdk`` accepts the SDK root or ``api/core``; ``FMOD_ANDROID_SDK`` can provide the "
"default path instead. Pin and retain a validated NDK so changes to godot-cpp's default NDK "
"version do not affect this project."

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:72 114767d779324f89ace37f8ab085bbac
msgid ""
"scons platform=android target=template_debug arch=arm64\n"
"scons platform=android target=template_release arch=arm64"
msgstr ""
"scons platform=android target=template_debug arch=arm64\n"
"scons platform=android target=template_release arch=arm64"

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:77 dda0853f8207410e9b905c04e129edc6
msgid "构建产物和 FMOD 运行库必须使用相同 ABI。其他架构使用 ``arch`` 选择，并检查扩展配置中的库条目。Java 与原生运行库的导出配置见 :doc:`../export`。"
msgstr ""
"The extension and FMOD runtime must use the same ABI. Select other architectures with ``arch`` "
"and check the library entries in the extension configuration. See :doc:`../export` for Java and "
"native runtime export setup."

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:80 f78cfe1cac6742ca852d593914cc5cbb
msgid "同步到测试项目"
msgstr "Stage the test project"

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:82 f701580255cd4200ad6bb61064dbf16a
msgid ""
"``copy_to_tests=yes`` 在构建成功后同步完整插件到 "
"``tests/addons/fmod_player``，即使二进制无需重编译，也会复制修改过的脚本、翻译和资源。Windows 和 Linux 同时复制本地 SDK 运行库；可用 "
"``fmod_runtime=/path/to/runtime`` 覆盖其来源。"
msgstr ""
"After a successful build, ``copy_to_tests=yes`` stages the complete addon in "
"``tests/addons/fmod_player``. It also copies changed scripts, translations, and resources when "
"the binary is already up to date. Windows and Linux builds copy the local SDK runtime; "
"``fmod_runtime=/path/to/runtime`` overrides its source."

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:84 ab4479bd133d4862b2fe8742be5a92d4
msgid "替换原生库前先关闭测试项目，完成构建后重新打开 ``tests/project.godot`` 并按 F5。无需另行运行外部测试脚本，菜单和编辑器检查步骤见 :doc:`testing`。"
msgstr ""
"Close the test project before replacing a native library. Reopen ``tests/project.godot`` after "
"the build and press F5. No separate external test runner is needed; see :doc:`testing` for menu "
"and editor checks."

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:87 2126b9a7785641c193853d5f263ee762
msgid "代码风格与接口变更"
msgstr "Code style and API changes"

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:89 b5d36200e73b4f2696554bccfec8f445
msgid "C++ 沿用当前文件的命名、缩进和指针引用写法，避免无关格式化。新增或修改 API 时，同时更新注册、XML、翻译和受影响示例。"
msgstr ""
"Follow the current C++ file's naming, indentation, and pointer/reference style. Avoid unrelated "
"formatting. When changing APIs, update registration, XML, translations, and affected examples "
"together."

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:90 1360ff4aaf5c4bcbb9687227aeadd6e1
msgid "GDScript 使用 UTF-8、LF、Tab 缩进和完整类型提示；函数与类定义前后留两个空行。"
msgstr ""
"Use UTF-8, LF, tabs, and explicit type hints in GDScript. Separate function and class definitions"
" with two blank lines."

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:91 08c103a5a0c94252ade016275d33cd2b
msgid "多行数组、字典和枚举保留末尾逗号；信号使用英文过去时名称；硬编码资源路径优先使用 UID。"
msgstr ""
"Keep trailing commas in multiline arrays, dictionaries, and enums. Name signals in the English "
"past tense and prefer UIDs for hardcoded resource paths."

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:92 b487222971994a39900e0f77c66a4526
msgid "浮点数保留前导和后缀零，例如 ``0.0``；变量不重复声明默认值；中文注释末尾不加句号。"
msgstr ""
"Keep leading and trailing zeros in floats, such as ``0.0``. Omit redundant default initializers "
"and final Chinese full stops in comments."

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:93 7a9bebe015d246a8bf69b38257ac8349
msgid "先声明信号和属性，再写方法；公共成员在前，私有成员在后；先初始化与虚函数回调，再写类接口。"
msgstr ""
"Declare signals and properties before methods, public members before private members, and "
"initialization and virtual callbacks before the class interface."

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:94 62f5da3d96c347ce82adcde4eef863b0
msgid "DSP 改动说明线程归属和缓冲区单位，区分字节、采样和完整音频帧；音频回调中减少分配与锁竞争，遵守 Godot 对象和脚本回调的线程约束。"
msgstr ""
"For DSP changes, document thread ownership and buffer units, distinguishing bytes, samples, and "
"complete audio frames. Minimize allocations and lock contention in audio callbacks, and respect "
"thread constraints for Godot objects and script callbacks."

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:97 9b2036ec69e041f784ff0ca8d9d4bdb4
msgid "构建与加载排查"
msgstr "Troubleshoot builds and loading"

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:99 eb0f2d28f3224aa8950c7f2daab8578b
msgid "找不到 NDK：确认 ``ANDROID_HOME`` 是 SDK 根目录，且 ``ndk_version`` 与本机安装目录一致。"
msgstr ""
"NDK not found: confirm that ``ANDROID_HOME`` is the SDK root and ``ndk_version`` matches an "
"installed directory."

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:100 e709c5b4a573497982d8c244f90595f6
msgid "提示旧 API JSON 文件不存在：检查本地配置是否仍设置 ``custom_api_file``。显式设置会覆盖 ``api_version``，普通构建可使用项目内置的 API 配置。"
msgstr ""
"Missing old API JSON: check whether local settings still specify ``custom_api_file``. An explicit"
" file overrides ``api_version``; ordinary builds can use the project's included API "
"configuration."

#: ../../source/contributing/development.rst:101 d619df6c02794abf8e13c84f02ba377d
msgid "动态库加载失败：检查平台、架构、Debug/Release 条目和 FMOD 运行库，查看 Godot 输出面板，参见 :ref:`faq-module-no-found`。"
msgstr ""
"Library loading failure: check the platform, architecture, Debug/Release entries, and FMOD "
"runtime, then inspect Godot's Output panel. See :ref:`faq-module-no-found`."
